{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6e96bb94a86d034b","name":"Yalpor Waar","source":{"id":"source:reference-6e96bb94a86d034b","title":"Yalpor Waar","revision":19814,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:39:12Z","sha256":"bed1256f7aae2cf5b9035be7316e385c326e6c5bbfb7a7c3dcb94343df85c5e4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19814","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Yalpor%20Waar&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6e96bb94a86d034b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A shifty ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quarren"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quarren","referenceId":"reference:f032fd9263dbff5e"}," from an influential clan on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"},", Yalpor Waar has seen his share of conflict throughout the galaxy. Civilized ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," prefer peace to warfare, but Yalpor insists that such actions are mere pretense. \"Someone is always fighting,\" he says. \"And who am I to stay their hands? Why not profit from the bloodshed, instead?\"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["And profit Yalpor has. Of the arms dealers in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point Nadir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point_Nadir","referenceId":"reference:480bbe618709d93f"},", Yalpor is one of the most successful. He prides himself on his available stock and allows customers to test weapons prior to buying them. Not only does Yalpor sell weapons, he is also intimately familiar with them. He makes a point to learn the peculiarities of the items he purveys; the knowledge makes him a more effective salesman.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While he works, Yalpor dresses in 